# Task train_12: every time the robot picks up at A, it must reach the
# inspection station B one or two steps later, and from that inspection
# onward it must stay out of the hazard zone X until it reaches the
# delivery bay C (a C at that B step or later is required; X is forbidden
# strictly between that B and its C, allowed on the C step). Vacuously
# satisfied if A is never visited.
every(A, within(B, 1, 2, then=avoid_until(X, C)))
